# Windows 11 hands-off

- Do not edit, create, or delete files inside `Urban Nail Bar (Windows 11)/`.
- Windows 11 must only stay synced from macOS High Sierra.
- Active development package: `Urban Nail Bar (macOS High Sierra)`.
- UI/code mirror: High Sierra → Big Sur + Windows 11 (never Windows → Mac).
- Shared data hub may still sync appointments/clients to all three.
- If Windows needs a change: edit High Sierra, then run `_sync/MIRROR-ALL-THREE.js`.
